          "widget": {
            "name": "headline",
            "textbox_spec": "# NFL Efficiency\nEvery play since 1999, refreshed each Tuesday. **EPA** = expected points added per play (nflverse model). Offense: higher is better. Defense is sign-flipped so higher is also better. **Luck gap** = net-EPA rank minus record rank: positive means the record flatters the team, negative means it is playing better than its record."
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 2
          }
        },
